<title>INDIA: CARE gives AAA rating to India IPCL bond.</title>
<headline>CARE gives AAA rating to India IPCL bond.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Credit Rating &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) on Thursday said it assigned a &quot;AAA&quot; rating for the 3.0 billion rupees non-convertible debenture issue of state-run Indian Petrochemicals Corporation Ltd (IPCL).  </p>
<p>CARE also assigned a AAA (FD) rating for a 2.5 billion rupee fixed deposit programme of IPCL, India's leading integrated petrochemicals firm.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
